      "html": "<details open><summary>No-video version \u00b7 use the same question</summary><figure><div role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Still model for Gas exchange in the lungs\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-labelledby=\"W4L2-visual-title-copy2 W4L2-visual-desc-copy2\" viewBox=\"0 0 640 360\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" style=\"font-family:Arial, sans-serif\">\n      <title id=\"W4L2-visual-title-copy2\">Scientific visual for this lesson</title>\n      <desc id=\"W4L2-visual-desc-copy2\">A local vector model used to support observation and reasoning. Labels and explanations are supplied in the lesson.</desc>\n      <defs><marker id=\"arrow-W4L2-visual-copy2\" orient=\"auto\" markerWidth=\"10\" markerHeight=\"10\" refX=\"8\" refY=\"3\"><path d=\"M0,0 L0,6 L9,3 z\" fill=\"#f1c764\"/></marker></defs>\n      <g style=\"--arrow-id:url(#arrow-W4L2-visual-copy2)\">\n      <g fill=\"#f1e8f7\" stroke=\"#a683be\" stroke-width=\"5\"><circle cx=\"220\" cy=\"140\" r=\"70\"/><circle cx=\"310\" cy=\"110\" r=\"62\"/><circle cx=\"360\" cy=\"185\" r=\"72\"/><circle cx=\"265\" cy=\"215\" r=\"65\"/></g>\n      <path d=\"M110 270c120-38 310-38 420 0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#c95f65\" stroke-width=\"28\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n      <path d=\"M220 120C270 145 280 210 300 250\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#6aaed6\" stroke-width=\"7\" marker-end=\"url(#arrow-W4L2-visual-copy2)\"/>\n      <path d=\"M390 250C375 215 365 180 350 150\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#d88478\" stroke-width=\"7\" marker-end=\"url(#arrow-W4L2-visual-copy2)\"/>\n      <text x=\"430\" y=\"90\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"16\">area</text><text x=\"430\" y=\"125\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"16\">distance</text><text x=\"430\" y=\"160\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"16\">maintained gradients</text></g>\n    </svg></div></figure><p>A thin wall gives a short diffusion distance. Oxygen moves down its concentration gradient from alveolar air into the arriving blood.</p></details>"
