" cy=\"164\" r=\"8\"/><circle cx=\"485\" cy=\"164\" r=\"8\"/><circle cx=\"525\" cy=\"164\" r=\"8\"/><circle cx=\"365\" cy=\"206\" r=\"8\"/><circle cx=\"405\" cy=\"206\" r=\"8\"/><circle cx=\"445\" cy=\"206\" r=\"8\"/><circle cx=\"485\" cy=\"206\" r=\"8\"/><circle cx=\"525\" cy=\"206\" r=\"8\"/><circle cx=\"365\" cy=\"248\" r=\"8\"/><circle cx=\"405\" cy=\"248\" r=\"8\"/><circle cx=\"445\" cy=\"248\" r=\"8\"/><circle cx=\"485\" cy=\"248\" r=\"8\"/><circle cx=\"525\" cy=\"248\" r=\"8\"/></g>\n      <rect x=\"295\" y=\"135\" width=\"50\" height=\"78\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"#7db3d7\"/><path d=\"M235 175h165\" stroke=\"#f1c764\" stroke-width=\"7\" marker-end=\"url(#arrow-W6L1-visual-copy2)\"/>\n      <text x=\"125\" y=\"335\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"17\">against gradient + membrane mechanism + cellular energy</text></g>\n    </svg></div></figure><p>Active transport causes net movement against the concentration gradient and requires energy released by respiration. The cell type alone does not prove the mechanism.</p></details>"
